// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P2574270361" "Hahahaha, your fear is delicious."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P2044177673" "I'm going to devour every happy memory you possess."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P3146724191" "Yes, cry, it makes your mind all the sweeter."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P1810048747" "I have you, little man."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P1710003177" "You're going to pay for what you did to her."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P1906939310" "Prepare yourself, little man."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P2856520718" "Have you ever seen what your id looks like? Let me show you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P3198478689" "Tsk tsk tsk, so much useless aggression for such a small mind."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P1759829223" "I think I'm going to take my time with this one."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_SEERS_ACTIVE :
"P1175226278" "Time to wake up, little sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_SEERS_ACTIVE :
"P1856897418" "Sleepytime is over, sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_SEERS_ACTIVE :
"P1671001379" "Mayhem's hold on you ends now, sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_SEERS_ACTIVE :
"P4093439569" "Settle down now, this will only hurt for a moment."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_SEERS_ACTIVE :
"P789108220" "Don't resist the gift we offer, little sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_SEERS_ACTIVE :
"P3518088141" "The chains are coming off today, sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_SEERS_ACTIVE :
"P185418008" "Embrace what we offer, or be damned."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P3808328732" "I am going to devour every happy memory you possess."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P4187904512" "Such darkness in one such as you, do you even know yourself?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P2654440923" "How many lives have you taken? I can sense them all."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P2010291010" "This is where your story ends, I'm afraid."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P1659965493" "I remember you. I've tasted your memories before."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P2945951129" "How could you have done that to her? She trusted you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P2454900575" "Such a disappointment. Who do you think you are hiding from, behind that ridiculous costume?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P722216990" "So sad that your life ends today, but a mother must feed."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P1126681905" "Hahahahaha, yes, desperation flavors the meat."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P2690100086" "Ahhh, such aggression, like a crystalline symphony."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P3135595806" "I know the pathways of your mind better than you ever shall."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_AMBUSHING_PLAYER_ALERTED :
"P486323999" "Ahhhhh....found you."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P1321497658" "Your magic will not protect you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P2469481807" "Such hubris, so sweet the fall."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P2604174495" "You do not belong here. You do not belong anywhere. You do not belong."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P1768365723" "How do you think you can stem the tide? With magic tricks?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P875365482" "Our power is beyond you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P846729411" "How strange, I cannot sense your mind. Clever."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P3755823078" "Your mind shall be consumed just like those who came before."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P1319998139" "Others have come. More guests for the feast."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P3327443381" "You have friends. How sweet."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P2352791703" "Ahhh. We were hoping you'd arrive."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P1894393640" "You have fallen into our trap."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P2874365452" "So many pretty minds. Such a banquet."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P3739623348" "Ahhhh, hahahahaha, do you think they will save you? Do you?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P739291627" "Ahhh, the darling ones have come to your aid. Join us."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P1166653914" "We welcome all to join the dance."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COL_ALERTED :
"P4130119479" "Your anger feeds on itself, so lovely."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3625476584" "Such anger! Such aggression! How lovely."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3438435574" "Your anger only makes you more our slave."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2657399911" "Come to me, embrace oblivion."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2685687786" "You've placed yourself in a cage you cannot even see. How pathetic."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2663737135" "So full of fear, how can you even function?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2581863276" "You think your hate frees you. It does not."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1290540854" "You are a peasant of the mind."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2349129438" "Such a primitive mind, how are you still alive?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P651249669" "Any last thoughts? Ah, there they are."








// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_RES_INACTIVE :
"P1443000538" "Why do you resist? Do you not see the futility of it?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2137539697" "This is the price you pay for following a delusional fool."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_RES_ALERTED :
"P1430913656" "Your anger feeds on itself. So lovely."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P3876462354" "There is no mind here to taste. Such a waste."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P1007401542" "Such bestial rage. Such hunger."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P967577496" "This meat has gone foul."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P3418640968" "Your destruction shall be a mercy."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P3296246067" "Begone, foul beast, you are of no interest to me."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P452601802" "Such a cruel fate to live as you do."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P2831130963" "I have come to end you, as you secretly desire."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P2487258134" "No, creature, I will not be your next meal."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_INACTIVE :
"P854142260" "Praetor Barry will pay for this outrage."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_ALERTED :
"P3070174767" "Ah, others have come to the dance."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_ALERTED :
"P3998841964" "Perhaps these new minds will hasten your demise, monster."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_ALERTED :
"P3628560947" "Come, join these monsters in death."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_ALERTED :
"P4175254764" "Ah, more interesting victims, these monsters make for poor meals."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_FE_ALERTED :
"P1674427574" "Ah, more appetizing prey."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P3611533386" "Time to bring you to heel."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P1477543813" "Stop your struggling, you belong with us."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P168382081" "You are a wild one, you will serve us well."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P215079369" "I understand your resistance, but you cannot deny us forever."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P1850638679" "How quaint, you still have a will of your own."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P1493354145" "Your rage is so....brilliant."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P422164802" "Our Mother really did a number on you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P1304062715" "Prove your usefulness, fulfill your destiny, fragment."


// FIRSTWARD_AWK_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2599331673" "Come, join us."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2353139296" "We've been waiting for you a long time."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P331892128" "Submit to us. I know you want to."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2683700555" "Look sister, more toys to play with."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2275122436" "It is about time you arrived, we were starting to wonder if you'd ever show up."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P937761189" "Hahahaha, new minds, fresh meat."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P21591750" "We were just thinking about you."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1369288959" "Green...anger...yes, it is."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2070044916" "No...no...yes...It is."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3858954454" "I sensed it...if so...yes."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2740001752" "Absolution...treasured...no...not ever."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P976590192" "I agree...our own...liar."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P584382911" "Silence...I feel it, yes."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4177642579" "Rage...your spite...do not invite it into you. No."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1997621850" "More every day...of course...quiet."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1752261014" "I have not. Never. Do not ask me that. Ever."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1798285557" "Mother...prepared...I agree."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2129958862" "Their anger...please do not...please."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1735569476" "Crawling in the dark...his voice...I will."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3387112198" "Regrets...too much, too soon...no...NO!"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1265841031" "Is it safe? Do not...no...too much fear."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2939055152" "Brought before us...rejected...consume it, no."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P267278596" "A spark...sharp, unforgiving...I shall."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3579357539" "Hahahaha, that is not funny, sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1004924158" "Yes....no...no...I said no, do not ask me again."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P304472828" "Too loud, sister...use your inner voice."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3849706189" "Do not try to hide it from me, sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1311612280" "Why do they resist?...Blind...dumb...awakened, yes."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3733007541" "Yes, it is. No...I have not forgotten."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3982761386" "Think clearly, sister...yes, like that."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1257375152" "Let me in...I said, let me in, sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1555215939" "Forever, yes...fierce thoughts are like molten sparks...they burn and are gone."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2700147525" "Do not doubt yourself...No...your weakness sickens me."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1737728639" "Yes....yes, I am aware...no, it is not."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3970585952" "Bring it before her...yes she will...you are mistaken."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1894934304" "Your thoughts are clouded, sister...here, let me."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1862858671" "If you allow it...blue, like a cloudless sky...hahaha, yes."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3511163395" "Why?...But why now?...It will come to pass."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3189090595" "They gather...you sense it too...down...down...down."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2148177109" "I have not forgotten...I can never...."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1396669700" "Broken...discarded, yes...you forget yourself, sister."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2947004142" "Extended into the other...over time...no...withdraw."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3917777133" "I hear...I obey."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2502689680" "Far thoughts draw near...welcome...I fear."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3005818861" "They are...we shall...Yes, we shall consume."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P401219754" "They bring the ending of things...we will welcome it."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2479039218" "You think as you once did...no...I do not believe you will."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P852121072" "Doubt...envy...it is...I have...and you will not."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3200012019" "I am...it is there...extend your thoughts...there."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2133994023" "Hmmm, I can...inner recesses...dig deeper."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2302380485" "What is this?...Compartmentalized...not forever."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1766301167" "each chamber...doors...the lock?...strange."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P740428701" "Eventuality...pre-destiny...the psychopomp...he is an outer fixation."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1459421251" "The Tall Stranger watches us...void...like a pause between breaths."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1536218012" "His fingers...like ice...endless hunger."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2832392078" "Yes, they will...by fear...no...it is worse than you can imagine."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P901723808" "Oblivion...release...joy...they cannot see what is coming."






// FIRSTWARD_AWK_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3056922262" "I do not need to hear your meat speaking, just think it."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1243400327" "Your flapping meat is offensive, imagine the answer and I will find it."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3540228802" "You are a vessel containing the knowledge I seek, not an animal who can speak."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3848100962" "Do not speak...it is like a fly buzzing in my ear."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3765335332" "Your words tell me nothing...your memories are what I seek."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1007691937" "Not...one...more...word...open your mind to me."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2980431140" "Speak animal, and be quick...your presence offends me."












// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1923158438" "A mind so empty, you will serve well."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1611958501" "A fresh vessel ready for occupation."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P138940469" "Do not resist, it will be more painful if you do."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P3883479974" "Sleep now, a new future awaits you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2976321253" "Your struggle ends now."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P587858779" "Do not cry, little man, we bring you a future without pain."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1819492188" "It will all be over soon."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P663249892" "Your anger will only bring you more pain."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2529935270" "Open yourself to me and your worry shall be at an end."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P722875558" "All your questions will be answered."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2970475687" "Such fire! You will make an excellent slave."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P663033705" "All your training has been for naught."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_CAPTURE_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2415598666" "You were meant to serve."








// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_INACTIVE :
"P2280800357" "No...please...don't."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_INACTIVE :
