// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_INACTIVE :
"P3741237472" "Nnn-nnnoooo....Yes, I will join you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_INACTIVE :
"P101840937" "What are you doing?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_INACTIVE :
"P3717524297" "Help...help me."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3081167927" "I'm not crazy, it's you that's crazy."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3662911889" "Have you seen my daughter?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3866636619" "Don't forget, the report is due on Monday."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P442103583" "Don't be silly, this suit is hand-made."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2841615814" "I haven't a care in the world, my new job is fantastic."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2170217550" "What are you doing here? You're not supposed to be here until tomorrow."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2361857243" "What's that noise? Did you say something?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2919768254" "He's gone, gone, gone."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2074250020" "Why do you keep resisting? Everyone is joining the club."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P105922665" "This is the future we were promised."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P186722913" "I'll bring the wine if you bring the meat."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P912475230" "Four, three, two, one...ready or not here I come."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3666630688" "I don't know what I'm doing here, I was supposed to be with my daughter today."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2572451325" "Did you get the gun? Alright, let's do this."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3034989824" "Everyone regrets a decision made in haste. Ask yourself, do you really love her?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2982390648" "It's so cold in here. Why is it so cold?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3802170943" "You make me so angry, I just want to carve you into bits."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P1621947306" "The more I look at you, the more I want to gouge out your eyes."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P1479145380" "I love you so much, I want to break every bone in your body."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3395094456" "I haven't the time to explain it to you, so I might as well kill you."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P2536945556" "Bones, snapping like twigs."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P241788321" "You'd look better without all that skin."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3303687599" "Going to hollow you out and wear you like a suit."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_HIVEMIND_ENTHRALLED_CITIZEN_ALERTED :
"P3234098914" "They told me that you must be destroyed. I agree."

// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P686918879" "They told me I was ugly...they're the ones who are ugly."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P852109958" "Wretched...filthy...debased...I am all of these, it is true."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P3527998677" "They said I was worthless, I am, I am worthless, and they'll pay."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P1953276109" "How dare they...how dare they judge me? Those worthless...dirty...scum-sucking FREAKS!"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P745777603" "I'll show them, I'll show them all. Think they're better than me. I'll make them wish they were never born!"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
