// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P4167748785" "I know what they're saying about me, I hear them, their secret smiles, their snickering. I'll pull their tongues out by the root."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P3099987455" "Looking at me with those eyes, judging me...dig my thumbs in...POP!"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P4173795313" "Burn them...and I'll laugh...watching their bodies turn black."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P1982915654" "Weed chipper, make short work of them...grind grind blood and gristle...heeheehee."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P1644115953" "Don't look at me, how dare you look at me? I know what you're thinking...dirty, dirty thoughts."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
"P731505984" "More and more they show me why they need to be destroyed. Worthless maggots feeding off my corpse."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASPECTOFHATE_INACTIVE :
