// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P2629324483" "Here...there...nowhere."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P3550359317" "What is that? I hear...."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P193458648" "There....is....no....escape."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P3845148640" "The songs....of the dead....call out to me..."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P659575359" "....what bells?...."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P2855418702" "Sweet....sweet....harmony of death...."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P341229633" "Across the gulf....they call to me."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
"P2464027744" "Living....dead.....there is no difference here."
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_INACTIVE :
