// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_ALERTED :
"P3716963144" "Am I real? Does this hurt you as much as it does me?"
// FIRSTWARD_AWK_ASTRALWANDERER_UNDERLING_ALERTED :
